 check the two deliveries?

TC | Scenario | Declarations | Example delivery | Expected result
TC1 | Standard export, one goods item | 8 | 80412233 | Accepted
TC2 | Export with multiple goods items | 4 | 80412590 | Accepted
TC3 | Amendment after goods issue | 2 | 80412611 | Accepted, version 2
TC4 | Cancellation of a declaration | 2 | 80412702 | Cancelled
TC5 | Declaration submitted by Nordline | 4 | 80412845 | Accepted
TC6 | Deliberate error (wrong commodity code) | 2 | 80412903 | Rejected with =
error code

